Package: LL3GAMLSS
Type: Package
Title: Three-Parameter Log-Logistic Distributional Regression
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Tolga Barış",
    family = "Terzi",
    email = "tolgabaristerzi@ktu.edu.tr",
    role = c("aut", "cre")
  )
Author: Tolga Barış Terzi [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Tolga Barış Terzi <tolgabaristerzi@ktu.edu.tr>
Description: Implements a support-safe three-parameter shifted log-logistic
    family for classic Generalized Additive Models for Location, Scale and
    Shape ('GAMLSS'). The validated nonstationary formulation estimates a
    constant threshold while allowing scale and shape to depend on covariates.
    It includes distribution functions, fitting and diagnostic helpers,
    independent numerical likelihood comparison, uncertainty procedures, and
    a calendar-month workflow for standardized precipitation-evapotranspiration
    indices.
